## Anti-Patent Litigation

If you bring a patent infringement claim against any contributor or licensee of the software based on the software, all your licenses under these terms end immediately.

## Automatic Remediation

If you violate these terms in any way, all your licenses under these terms end immediately. However, if you clear the violation within 30 days of when you first find out about it, your licenses are reinstated.

